From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristjan Sillmann <kristjan.h.s@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 10:52:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dark-off

vic-engine: ReactToDarkness leaves OptionalReactions, so a dim room never plays the light-to-dark startle anim.
Woken in a dim room outside the night window, it looked around, startled and suggested sleep every 30 s (its cooldown),
but BehaviorSleepCycle ignores sleep suggestions for 10 min after a wake (kSleepCycle_RecentSleepLength_s): 15 head
jerks in 10 min on 11-09. Sleep still comes from sleepiness, the night window and the nap lock. The behavior stays
defined (MeetVictor's suppression list still finds it by ID).
---
 .../victorBehaviorTree/reactions/optionalReactions.json         | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/resources/config/engine/behaviorComponent/behaviors/victorBehaviorTree/reactions/optionalReactions.json b/resources/config/engine/behaviorComponent/behaviors/victorBehaviorTree/reactions/optionalReactions.json
index f1705722..d95b7417 100644
--- a/resources/config/engine/behaviorComponent/behaviors/victorBehaviorTree/reactions/optionalReactions.json
+++ b/resources/config/engine/behaviorComponent/behaviors/victorBehaviorTree/reactions/optionalReactions.json
@@ -14,7 +14,7 @@
   },
   
   "behaviors": [
-    "ReactToDarkness",
+    // my-vector dark-off: no ReactToDarkness; woken in a dim room it head-jerked every 30 s for the 10 min wake grace
     "GreetAfterLongTime",
     "ReactToUncalibratedHeadAndLift",
     "DanceToTheBeatCoordinator"
